Bundled embedding model data
============================

potion-base-8M-int8.npz and potion-base-8M-vocab.txt are derived from the
Model2Vec model "minishlab/potion-base-8M" (revision
bf8b056651a2c21b8d2565580b8569da283cab23), https://huggingface.co/minishlab/potion-base-8M,
licensed under the MIT License. Its vocabulary comes from BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5
(MIT License). The vectors were quantized to 8-bit integers with one float32
scale per token by the Context Engine project; no other changes.

